      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Jato. A água armazenada no tufo da cabeça de Panpour é rica em nutrientes. Ele usa a cauda para regar plantas, que crescem bastante ao receber esse líquido.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Panpour pode evoluir para Simipour no nível 8 ou superior, com a ajuda de uma Water Stone. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Play Nice, Scratch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Leer</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Lick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Fury Swipes</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Water Sport</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Scald</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Taunt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Fling</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Acrobatics</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Brine</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Recycle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Natural Gift</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Crunch</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aqua Tail, Attract, Blizzard, Confide, Covet, Double Team, Endeavor, Facade, Fling, Focus Punch, Frustration, Gastro Acid, Grass Knot, Gunk Shot, Hail, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Ice Beam, Ice Punch, Icy Wind, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Payback, Protect, Rain Dance, Recycle, Rest, Return, Rock Tomb, Role Play, Round, Scald, Shadow Claw, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Surf, Swagger, Taunt, Thief, Torment, Toxic, Uproar, Water Pledge, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Aqua Ring, Aqua Tail, Astonish, Covet, Disarming Voice, Hydro Pump, Low Kick, Mud Sport, Nasty Plot, Role Play, Tickle</p>",
